# Go backend — notes

Follow [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md), root [fail-fast-no-fallbacks.mdc](../../../../.cursor/rules/fail-fast-no-fallbacks.mdc),
[architecture-standard.mdc](../../../../.cursor/rules/architecture-standard.mdc), and [go-backend.mdc](../../../../.cursor/rules/go-backend.mdc).

- `PUBLIC_BASE_URL`, `INTERNAL_API_TOKEN`, billing gRPC required at startup.
- `service.New` panics if `Repo`, `Billing`, or `PublicBaseURL` missing — no mid-request invents.
- Ports (`repository.Store`, `billing.Client`) use mockery; service tests use generated mocks only.
- Transport: 1 RPC = 1 file under `internal/app/api/notes/`.
- No unused DTO fields; no `SELECT` columns discarded after scan.
